# Raw and derived data are never committed: collect at source, every time.
**/data/*
!**/data/README.md

# Tableau working files belong on ZoneCours and Tableau Public, not in the course repository.
*.twb
*.twbx
*.hyper
*.tde
*.tfl
*.tflx
Tableau Repository/

# Quarto build cache and rendered decks. Sources (.qmd) are committed; renders are not.
.quarto/
*_files/
*.html
# ...except the GitHub Pages site, which must be committed for Pages to serve it.
!docs/*.html

# Live assessments — never commit: the repository is public.
assessments/**/LIVE/

# OS
.DS_Store

# Stray web pages saved while checking sources
/*.htm
